{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warfare is obsolete!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods have forbidden bloodshed over land. Now, kings face each other in a trial of strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each presents a ten-year vision for expanding their realm, and the one with the sharper plan wins it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/c3ff6fcb8bf5496f95257ef80fe0d4da.poster.avif?t=1765963725\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/c3ff6fcb8bf5496f95257ef80fe0d4da.webm?t=1765963725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/c3ff6fcb8bf5496f95257ef80fe0d4da.mp4?t=1765963725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan your kingdom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange your buildings carefully on the scroll \u2014 each choice will shape your kingdom\u2019s growth for the next decade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/dc109ae459a5954b68bac8f152651bed.poster.avif?t=1765963725\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/dc109ae459a5954b68bac8f152651bed.webm?t=1765963725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/dc109ae459a5954b68bac8f152651bed.mp4?t=1765963725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch your plans unfold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your scrolls are set, the years unfold. Watch as your strategies clash in dynamic, unpredictable battles \u2014 where even a single building can decide the fate of your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/247a5ddffeee1b052ddeb8673419ee82.poster.avif?t=1765963725\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/247a5ddffeee1b052ddeb8673419ee82.webm?t=1765963725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/247a5ddffeee1b052ddeb8673419ee82.mp4?t=1765963725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your play style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rule as Human, Undead, Beast, and more \u2014 each with unique abilities and buildings to shape your ideal kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/35cdfb369d840bed4b8061b7ee3ea3f2.poster.avif?t=1765963725\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/35cdfb369d840bed4b8061b7ee3ea3f2.webm?t=1765963725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122080/extras/35cdfb369d840bed4b8061b7ee3ea3f2.mp4?t=1765963725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vast lands await conquest \u2014 so sharpen your wit and claim thy land.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122080?t=1765963725","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122080?t=1765963725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat